    Reported-by: kernel test robot <ying.huang@linux.intel.com>
    Link: lkml.kernel.org/r/87fuwk1c0o.fsf(a)yhuang-dev.intel.com
    Signed-off-by: Rob Herring <robh@kernel.org>

